From 4777d64d26c64448ca9fc0e11c79c4f80bd72df7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: preview <preview@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 07:24:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Web preview for marketing recordings: the real screens in a
 browser at phone size

Regenerated 2026-11-14 against Ghost Light main 50a1c23 as one commit (the seven earlier ones folded together).
The sides upload shim moved into sendFile and sendable, because scan, upload-background, scene-map and
add-scenes now all go through them.
